+# Saved guest setup
+
+The private manager can save owner, keyboard, timezone and hostname defaults for new virtual machines. Enable Guest Defaults in the manager, then choose whether to apply them in New VM. Existing guests keep their settings.
+
+The prepared VM image uses Omarchy's owner setup rather than the ISO installer's disk configuration. Disk partitioning, encryption and Tailscale inputs are not part of this flow. A changed factory setup contract returns to the normal wizard and reports a fixed failure code. SSH remains a separate key-based integration.
