 ## VMs from older versions
 
 Versions of the app before 1.0 used a different kind of VM, which this version can't launch. Your old VM's files stay where they were, and the new VM can read them. To copy your files and packages over, choose **Setup → Import Previous VM** in the Omarchy menu, or run `try-omarchy-import-previous --dry-run` to see what would be copied.
+
+## Omarchy VM Manager downloads
+
+When the separate Omarchy VM Manager app creates guests, they reuse a factory download in `~/Downloads/Omarchy VM Manager/Factory Images/`. The current image stays cached; obsolete image downloads are removed after at least seven days without use. You can remove that cache to reclaim space while no guest is being prepared. Existing guests keep their own disks and do not need the download to start.
